Z||000006||ChadMan||09-16-2001||09:26 PM||||Yeah, poor Alex...it was heartbreaking to watch.  I really wish he had just taken his millions and his wife and little boy and stayed retired, but that just wasn't his style.  I hope he recovers fully and soon.||||reg||9
