Z||000009||Fformula88||09-17-2001||10:24 AM||||Its tragic when something like this happens... and even more amazing when it happens to such a skilled driver.  It sure is a risky sport!  At least he wasn't killed, however I am sure life will be tough for him and his family.  My prayers are with them!<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero2m6siga.JPG">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif"> <P>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
